From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:43:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] docs: describe the CLI as a client of the REST API

README gains a command line section: the default URL (the gateway) and
how to reach the control plane directly, where the API key comes from,
the commands, the semantics of apply and wait, error messages, exit
codes and environment variables. CHANGELOG records the new CLI, the
breaking changes against the in-memory CLI and the dependency fix.
module-mapping adds the CLI as module 19, with an import scan showing
that it depends only on the standard library and PyYAML.
